<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Lamm</book>
  <para style="h">Filibuyi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus Sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ FILBU I BI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filbu yi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fili</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus Sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIBUYI</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Bulus Sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ Filibuyi</char> Shɔ bee yɛnɛ shɔ gɨnnɛ gbete isi ɗekɨn yɛ bi gbete Bulus ɓeli a tipi Iropiyayi, a tipi Rooma a kaa Masdoninya. Shɔ beerɛ jashonɛu si a jahm, a ɗagbete naa u si a yɛti raɓoonɛ a shɔgbete gãsi i bẽu vishonɛyɛ, pɔ̃u a yukɔnɛ a vi matinɛ gbete ɓa dang ɓayɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa gbete a tipi Filipiya. A shɔmni piti sẽkoom ɔ̃kinɛ n ti tɔ̃vɨn ntanɛ a kaka bi gbete shɔ taudɔɔyɛ aka Bulus sisɨn ãnɛ pɔ̃nɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi bi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vigbete sɨnrɛ shɔ bee sẽkou aru shɔu dɔ̃ri shɔ Kirisa gbete i a Filipiya yɛ aru vigbete i shoshiu yɛ nɛu pɔ̃siunaa a ɗagbete kasiyɛ. Pɛli vishonɛ a yɛnki gbete kpaayɛ aru u kpaariyi sisɨn, aru gbete iyɛ kpaa bilakinɛ au yɛti yuu yɔrinɛ piti kpai ai ɓɛɛni. Gakiyi rɛ nɛi ɔ̃ a sisɨn yuu roorinɛ naa Yesɔ, a kang-gbete iyɛ ɔ̃ ai sisɨn vi kpaanɛkɔ sheeli a yuu baasinɛ. Kpaariyi sisɨn aru i ɔ̃nɛ yuu ɓasinɛ a Kirisini pɛ Ɗalapa vitɔ̃vɨng ãnɛ gbete ai tɛyɛ a kaa sisɨn ãnɛ, ɓanɛ aru Yahudawayi nya ãsinɛ yumusinɛɓa. Bee vim a sisɨn puru a ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn gbete Ɗalapa ã shɔgbete ai ɔ̃nɛ yuɓasnɛ a Kirisiniyɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sẽkoom beenɛ nwanya ba a yuu ɔ̃nɛ sisɨn tɔ̃vɨn, bilakinɛ, yuuɓasinɛ, sisɨn maanɛ a ɔ̃nɛ Kirisa tɔ̃vɨn ãnɛ. Vim ɓeli wɔsɔ̃n gbete Bulus pɔ̃ au sisɨn aru shɔ Filipiyayi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bulus nyanwanɛ aru ɔ̃nɛ gbete pɛliyɛ (1.12-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔ̃nɛ a yɛti Kirisi (1.27-2.18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Shɔ maasi Timoti Ruu a Ipaforoditu (2.19-30)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yusho gɔ̃nɛ aru shɔ nɔ̃pɔ̃yi a shɔ nyɔnɛyi (3.1-4.9)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bulus a ɓesa Filipiyayi (4.10-20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisinɛ (4.21-23)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s1">Sẽkoo Gbete Bulus Beeri Shɔ Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Sẽkoom shɛ a Bulus a Timoti i naa, Kirisi Yesɔ jawɛrɛyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Yɛnɛ Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi gbete i a tipi Filipiya yɛ kpai, shɔgbeteyi ɓasiyuu a Kirisi Yesɔniyɛ, piti a yupɛ̃ni Ɗa wɛrɛyini a shɔgbeteyi pɔ̃sɔɔnaayɛni:<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa u ɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisini u ãwɔ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Ɗa Gakinɛ Aru Shɔ Filipiyayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />N kɛ kpaasisɨn nɛ awɔ yuu n dɔ̃ri n Ɗalapa tɔ kopiɗaviya; <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Kopiɗaviya n gaki Ɗa a sisɨn puru awɔ yuu piti kpai, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />yunɛ dii gaanɛ anɛ dɔdɔrim n nta yɛti purutɛ nɔgbete ɔ pɔ̃sinnaa ɔ geli shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn a Yesɔ Kirisi yuu yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Nyamasinɛ ɓa Ɗalapa shɔgbeteu gaa vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn awɔ bim, yɛ yɛ ɗekɨn awuni sitɛ yisitɛ, anɛ leegbete Kirisi Yesɔ yɛ a yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />N ɔrɔɔtɔ fɛ̃ɛm ɔ kpai! Kɛ ruukɔ n lɛri kɛkn awɔ yuuni naam. Aruviya ɔ ɓasiyutɔ a nkɔni atette Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ aɗagbete shɔmang a jaahmyɛ, wɔsɔ̃n a ɗagbete n shi ayuu ruu tɔ̃vɨn a kakani shɔ gbete n zɛ tɛttɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Ɗalapa kɔ ɔ̃rɛ n shɔ shinɛkɨnti, nɛn gelɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn aɗagbete n shayɛ nɛ, ɔ ɔrinɛ ang sisɨn gbikiri-gbikiri naa Kirisi Yesɔ ɔrɔɔyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />N gaki Ɗa ɔ ɔrinɛ u barɛ u yɛ ɗekɨnɗekɨn, a vizɛnɛ tɔ̃vɨn ni a ruuyeenɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛni, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />nɔgbete ɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ vitɔ̃vɨng lɔnɛ gbete shɔ pɛliyɛ. Ɔ yɛ ɔ̃kɛ wasa-wasa a leegbete Kirisi yɛ sɔɔyɛ ɔ ɔ̃ toti a ruuvinini ɓa. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Ɔ ɔ̃nɛ yɛ ɔ̃kɛ tɔ̃vɨn tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ gbete shɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi biiyɛ, nɔgbete shɔ kɛ zɛ wɔɔ vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨn nɛ i yɛ gɨn ji ukɔ i bassi Ɗalapa rɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">U Ɔ̃nɛ Pɛ Kirisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />N shɔbiiyi n kasirɛ ɔ zɛtɔ, vigbete au kpan si yɛ ukɔ pɔ̃naa ruu tɔ̃vɨn yɛ ɗekɨn rɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Aru nankɔ shɔ kpati wɛrɛ ganɛyi kpai, a shɔ gãsi gbeteyi aɗɔm i zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ shɔ mang a jahm aru nɛn pɛ Kirisi jawɛrɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />N ɔ̃nɛ a jaahm ã shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi kakatɛ fɛ̃ɛm i pɔ̃ sisɨntɛ a Uɓeyelapa biini, nɔgbete i ba a kakani i nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn kopiɗaviya setintanɛ ɓa.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Pɛnizɛ shɔwɔyi i nwari shɔ ruu Kirisi aru gɨnkaanɛ a nyamasinɛ, ama zɔ gãsiyi a nyaba tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Shɔgbeteyi nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨnmiyi i nwa pɛ aru ɔrinɛ, i zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ Ɗalapa ãng vishonɛ nɛn shi ayuu ruu tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Zɔ gãsiyi i nwa ruu Kirisi ɓa a sisɨn gbete ɓa ama i kasi ba i yuu; ai sisɨn nɛn pɔ̃ng yukɔnɛ fɛ̃ɛm aɗagbete n si a jaahmyɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ɓa viyuu yɔrinɛ ɓa! N nta sisɨn purutɛ au yuuni. Jo nankɔ shɔ nwa Kirisi ruubikɨn ko-pi nyaba-shɔpiya, ko a nyaba gɔlɔrɔ ko a nyaba tɔ̃vɨn. N yɛn yɛ ɗekɨn a sisɨn puru ntanɛni, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />aruviya n zɛ tɛttɔ ɔ Ɗa gakinɛ ang yuu a Ɗa suru naapɔ̃nɛ au shɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi kabiiyɛ n yɛn kpaa naraanɛtɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />N vigbete n kasi fɛ̃ɛm a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛni n kɔ nwesinɛ ang vishonɛni, ama kopiɗaviya, badijo dɔdɔrim, n sisɨn u lakinɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm, nɔgbete ang vishonɛ kpai Kirisi u kpaa basinɛtɔ ang kabiini, ko n a suru ni ko n vɔtɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Ang ɓɛɛ n ɔ̃nɛ a suruni pɛ aru Kirisi, n vɔnɛ yɛ tɛɛ ɔ̃nɛtɔ a suruni a kotipinni. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Ama n kɛ yɛ ɗekɨn nɛ a ɔ̃nɛ a kotipimni n yɛn pɛli vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn fɛ̃ɛm, n ji zɛ vigbete n yɛ lɔyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Vizitim sɨntɛ n sisɨn vãkɛtɛttɔ. N kasirɛ n vɔtɔ n ɔ̃ a Kirisini a kolapa, aruviya ukɔ yɛ kɔrirɛ u tɛɛ n ɓɛɛ ɔ̃nɛ a kotipimni; <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />ama awɔ yuu pɛ tɔ̃vɨn fɛ̃ɛm n ɔ̃ a suruni. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />N zɛ vim tɛttɔ, n yɛn ɔ̃tɔ a ɔkɔɔni, aru ɔ kpaa banɛ awɔ ɗekɨn yɛnɛ a sisɨn puru ntanɛ atette sisɨn ãnɛni, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />nɔgbete nkɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃nnɛ a ɔkɔɔniyɛ, ɔ yɛ kpaa vibaasinɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm ang yuuni awɔ ɔ̃nɛ atette yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni. <verse eid="PHP 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Dɔdɔrim vitɔ̃vɨng ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔ̃nɛ u ɔ̃ naa ruu tɔ̃vɨn Kirisi kasiyɛ, nɔgbete ko n atɛ ko n jo a ɓa n zɛwɔrɛ ɓa, n yɛn ntatɔ nɛ ɔ shitɛ dɔkaziti ayuu vigbete, ɔ nya gbete, ɔ ɗɔɔ bawaanɛ a nyazɔɔ aru sisɨn ãnɛ ayuu ruu tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Ɔkɔɔ nta ɔ shɔnɔpɔ̃yi setinɛ; ko-piɗaviya ɔ mabiitɔ, shɔmkɔ yɛ tasiyirɛ nɛi yɛi nwesitɔ, Ɗa yɛ shaarɔɔtɔ, aruviya pɛ Ɗalapakɔ ãwɔ naraanɛrɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Aruviya shɔ ãwɔ naatɛ ɔ shoshi Kirisi vishonɛ, ɓanɛ aru sisɨn ãnɛ au bikɔ sheeli ɓa ama wɔsɔ̃n aru raa gbete ɔ ɓoo au yuuyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Dɔdɔrim ɔ yɛ waaba dɔɔtɔ naa n waayɛ a nkɔni nyazɔ. Jo ba gbete ɔ zɛn si aɗɔ waanɛyɛkɔ, ji naa ɔ ntayɛ, gbete n doo aɗɔ waanɛm.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kirisa Yuuroorinɛ a Kirisi Yuuyorinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Ɔ Suru a Kirisi bi ukɔ masɔɔbiirɛ, u ɔrinɛkɔ roorɔɔ sisɨnrɛ. Ɔ yuɓasinɛtɔ a Ɗa Suruni ya? Ɔ ɔ̃nɛ tasinɛ tɔ̃vɨn a raatanɛni aɗɔni ya? <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Aru nankɔ n gakɔɔtɔ ɔ pɔ̃nrɛ n kpaa sisɨn purutɔ fɛ̃ɛm u lɛrinɛ u ɔ̃ gbete, u ɔrinɛ u ɔ̃ gbete, u ɔ̃ gbete a suru, u sisɨn u ɔ̃ gbete. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ɔkɔɔ pɛli viwɔɔnɛ aru ɔ yuu kasinɛ, ko aru yuu bassinɛ, ama ɔ roorɔɔ yuutɔ a zɔ biini, kopiɗaviya ɔ tuu shɔwɔyi naa i tɛwɔ tɛttɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Ɔkɔɔ kɔnɛ ɔ yuukɔ sheeli ama ɔ wesho jo zɔ gãsiyi ɓɛɛni. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Ɔ ruubii u ɔ̃ jo naa Kirisi Yesɔ ɓɛɛyɛ:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Kopiɗaviya Yesɔ kirisi u ɓɛɛjo Ɗalapa kɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">ama ji pɔ̃ ɓa sisɨn ni ɓa ko a kaka nɛn zali a Ɗalapa niɓa.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />A nɔgbete si pɛli vim, au kasinɛ a ã vigbete u a wuniyɛ kpai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">a risiu yuu naa jawɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">risiu yuu naa shɔzɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">a shɛ a shɔzɛ jasuru.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Roori yuu a gɨn Ɗalapa nyarɛ au n-tiurɛ shɔ nyo vɔrɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">aka naɓaanɛ a laa.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Aruumkɔ Ɗalapa basiu fɛ̃ɛm tɛɛ vi piti kpai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">a ãu nii gbete au tɛɛ nii gãsiyitɔ piti kpai.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Aru Yesɔ nii bassinɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">vi piti a lapa a kotipini, a koo gbete a tɔ̃ɔ̃ tipi dii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">i yɛ ta a yugboti a Yesɔ ɗekɨn<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />i piti kpai i yɛ nwa Yesɔ Kirisi ruubiitɔ nɛu pɛ Uɓeyelapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">aru shɔu bassi Ɗalapa u Ɓeye.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ Kolinɛ Naa Ɗɔsẽsẽ a koo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Aru nankɔ n shɔbiiyi gbete n ɔrinɛyɛ, ji naa ɔ gɨn n nya a lee-lee yɛ a ɗagbete n si a ɔkɔɔniyɛ, yɛ kɔritɔ ɔ ɔrin bajo dɔdɔrimkɔ a ɗagbete n ɓa a ɔkɔɔni ɓam. Ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a vishonɛ pɛlinɛ atette Ɗalapa setintanɛ a bizaanɛni nɔgbete ɔ yɛ yisi vishonɛ gbete yɛ ãwɔ raanɛyɛ, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />aruviya kopiɗaviya Ɗalapa u ɗɔvishonɛ awɔ yuuni u pɔ̃wɔrɛ awɔ kasinɛ ɔ gɨu vigbete kasiyɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />A vigbete ɔ pɛli kpai ɔkɔɔ nwalinya wɔɔnɛ ko ɔkɔɔ masinyanɛ, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />nɔgbete ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ shɔ gbete i ruuvini ɓa tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ wasak naa Ɗalapa jaayi, shɔgbeteyi ɔ̃ a koo gbete shɔ kuli shɔ nɔɔ a shɔ ruuviyini. Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ koli ai tete naa sɛ koli a nyasiyɛ, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />naa ɔkɛ geli shɔ ruu gbete ã suruyɛnɛ. Ɔkɛ shanɛ, sin kpaa vigbete n baasi awɔ yuutɛ a leegbete Kirisi yɛ ayɛni, aruviya yɛ tasitɔ nɛ n bimanɛ ang vishonɛni kpai ji yɛ ɓa weze ɓa.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Ama ko shɔu tẽeng kpaa naa vi-ãnɛ gbete ɔ sisɨn ã Ɗalapa viyuu ãnɛyɛ. Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nankɔ, si n nta sisɨn purutɛ, n yɛn nta sisɨn purutɔ a kooni kpai. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Ji nankɔ, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ nta sisɨn purutɔ, ɔ tasi sisɨn puru ntanɛtɔ a nkɔni.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timoti a Abaporiditu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Kɛ ɔ̃nɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kasinɛ, yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔ ɓa n pɔ̃ sisɨn n yɛn zɛnɔɔtɔ n sho Timotirɛ awɔ ɗɔbiini, nɔgbete n yɛn kpaa bi lakinɛ ayuu ruu gbete n nta awɔ yuuni. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Ji ukɔ sheeli nta ruu ang nya a shɔgbete au yɔriyuu awɔ yuuniyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Ko-piya yɔriyuu jo au ɓɛɛ vishonɛkɔ sheeli, ama ɓa ayuu vigbete sã Yesɔ Kirisi ruubiiyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Ama ɔ awɔ yuu ɔ zɛ nɔgbete Timoti tasiu vishonɛyɛ tɛttɔ, nɔgbete u a nkɔni, naa javɔshɔ a ɓeye, u pɛli vishonɛ tɛttɔ a ɗɔɔzɔ ayuu ruu tɔ̃vɨn ni. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔni ɓa nkɛ nta vigbete yɛ kpaan yɛnɛ n pɔ̃tɛ sisɨn n-tɛ n yɛn shoutɔ awɔ ɗɔbii.<verse eid="PHP 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />N ã sisɨntɛ au Uɓeyelapa biini, yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa n yɛn awɔ ɗɔbiitɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />N zɛ ang sisɨn n-tɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn n shoshi ɔ mazɔ̃ Abaporiditu, shɔgbete au pɛli vishonɛ au waaba naa jashonɛ a nkɔni aru u shi ayuu ruu tɔ̃vɨn au pɔ̃sing naa. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Zassibiitɛ fɛ̃ɛm aru kasɔɔ zɛnɛ kpai, yɔriyuutɛ fɛ̃ɛm aru ɔ nta nɛu vɔrɔyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Nizɛ usi vɔrɔ nakɛ vɔnɛ, ama Ɗalapa ntau raatɔ, si ɓa au yuukɔ sheeli ɓa ama a nkɔni, si ɓa ɗɔkɔ ɓa n yɛti lɛsinɛ si ɔ̃ bang. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Ukɔ sɨnrɛ n kasirɛ fɛ̃ɛm n shourɛ toti awɔ ɗɔbii nɔgbete ɔ nta sisɨn puru naa ɔkɛ zɛunɛyɛ, n yɛti lɛsinɛ yɛ yisinyakɛtɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Ɔ tɛu nakaziti a sisɨn puru, naa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Uɓeyelapa bi. Shɔ naa shɔmiyi ɔ tasiyi basinɛtɔ kpai naa ukɔ, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />aruviya mɛliu suru tɛttɔ naakɛ vɔnɛ maani aru Kirisi vishonɛ, aru u pɔ̃sinnaa ayuu vigbete ɔ awɔ yuu ɔ ji zɛnɔɔ pɛlinɛ ɓayɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Tɔ̃vɨn Pɛlinɛ Gaanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Au nyayisnɛ, n shɔbiiyi ɔ nta sisɨn purutɔ awɔ yuɓasinɛ au Uɓeyelapani. Yuu Ji wam ɓa n pasɔɔ vigbete n beerɔɔ siyɛ ɓa, ɔ yɛ ranaatɔ naa nkɛ pɛlinɛ nankɔ yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Ɔ kɔyuutɔ aru shɔgbete i pɛli vikɔ̃linɛyi ni, zaamiyi, shɔgbete ai pɔ̃ shɔ a kaka nɛ shɔu yee shaatɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Pɛ ukɔu shɔgbete i tɛ gaanɛ shaa yeenɛyɛ, ɓa ikɔ ɓa, aru ukɔu bassi Ɗalapa rɛ au ka suru, au ka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni u nta sisɨn purutɛ au ɔ̃nɛni. U bassi ɓɛɛjo Kirisi Yesɔ u pɔ̃ sisɨn ɓa shɔzɛ vipɛlinɛni ɓa. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />N vishanɛ aɗɔn aru gbete n pɔ̃ sisɨn ang vipɛlinɛ. Naa shɔwɔ awɔ tete kɛtɔnɛn pɔ̃ sisɨn a shɔzɛ vipɛlinɛni, n vishanɛ aɗɔn waanɛ gbete tɛu ɓɛɛ tɛttɔyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Shɔ yeerin shaa sin pɛlitɛ lumɔɔ gbete. Shɔ yeeng a tipi Israila, n pɛ Benjamɛyi nyakoo, maye a manini i pɛ shɔ Ibirniyawayi. Nɔgbete Musa nya ãsinɛ sãyɛ, n sipɛ shɔ Farisiya. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />N shi a kakani fɛ̃ɛm aruviya n-tɔ mɛnɛ n-tɛ pɛlinɛ vigbete Ɗalapa kasinɛn pɛliyɛ, n tasi shɔgbeteyi gɨn Yesɔ i raa fɛ̃ɛm. Si kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a nyabankɔ shɔyi gɨn Musa nya ãsinɛ tɔ̃vɨn n ruuvini ɓa. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ama vigbete n yɛn ga naa Ɗa sharin au yuuniyɛ, dɔdɔrim n gai kɛ atette vigbete raasin naatɛ aru n yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Ɓa viwayikɔ sheeli ɓa; n tuu vipiti kpai n-tɛ raanatɛ kpai, aru vigbete si a ɗɔn waanɛ fɛ̃ɛm, vizɛnɛ ayuu Kirisi Yesɔ Uɓeyelapa. Aru u yuukɔ n loki ko-iviyatɛ piti kpai; n tuyitɛ naa vishaanɛ gbete lɛsitɛttɔyɛ, nɔgbete n kpaa Kirisi sɔ̃nyɛ <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />anɔgbete n ɓasi yuu awuni dangdang. N tɔ̃vɨn gbete n pɛli ang yuu aka Musa nya ãsinɛ tɔɓa, dɔdɔrim n kɛ a tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ gbete shɔ kpaa atette sisɨn ãnɛ a Kirisi bi, tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ gbete shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiiyɛ shɔ kpaa ɓɛɛ nɔgbete sisɨn ãnɛ ɔ̃yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Vigbete ang kasiyɛ piti kpai n zɛ Kirisi, n zɛu kaka gbete yulapa a saa a wuniyɛ, n ɓooraa awuni, n ɔ̃ naa ukɔ a nyaba vɔnɛ gbete vɔyɛ, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />ang sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ n ang yuu n ɔ̃ atette shɔgbete Ɗalapa yɛ yusiyi lapa a suruniyɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bi Manɛ Yɛnɛ u Nyasinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />N jo tung yuu ɓanɛ Ɗa shaarintɛttɔ gboti ɓa ko nɛn zɛnɔɔ tɛttɔ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ ɓa. Ama n ɗɔgbete n yɔkiyɛ n kpaa Ɗa shaarinɛ gbete Kirisi Yesɔ kpaarin tɛttɔ gboti au yuu. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />N shɔbiiyi ɓa nizɛ ɓa, n ji lɛri ɓa ang sisɨn nɛ Ɗa sharintɛttɔ gboti ɓa; vigbete n pɛliyɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ko-pikoviya n sukitɔ a vigbete ang kɨntiyɛni n pɛli vigbete n yɛn pɛliyɛ n kpaa vigbete ang ɗekɨntɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Aruukɔ n yusururu yɛnɛ u nyayisinɛ aru n kpaa vigbete Ɗa yɛ sharin au yuuyɛ, ukɔ Ɗalapa nyaɓaanɛ yɛnɛ kolapa aru vigbete Kirisi Yesɔ pɛli ang yuuyɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />U shɔgbete u kpẽnɛ aɗɔn a suruyɛ u vipɛlinɛ u ɔ̃ gbete. Ama naa ɔ zɔ gãsiyi ikɛ ɔ̃nɛ a sisɨn wɔɔni tot, Ɗalapa yɛ tasɔɔ vimtɔ wasa-wasa. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Vigbete yɛ kɔriyɛ u yɛ ɗekɨn ɓɛɛ jo a nyaãsinɛ gbete Ɗalapa tasiuyɛ anɛ dɔdɔrim.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />N shɔbiiyi ɔ ɓasiyuu a zɔ gãsiyini ɔ gɨn ɓɛɛ jo n dɔɔ vipɛlinɛ. Ɔ wesho a shɔgbete i gɨn vitasinɛ tɔ̃vɨn gbete u pɔ̃sɔɔyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Nagbete n gelɔɔ vim sitɛttɔ a nɔɔ gelinɛ, dɔdɔrim n pasitɛ a murini nɔɔ: shɔzɛ waanɛ ai ɔ̃nɛ tasinɛ i pɛ Kirisi shɔnɔɔpɔ̃ au vɔnɛ gbete shɔ ɓaunaa a laayɛni. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Akɨntini kpai i yɛ to wɛrɛ yaa, aruviya i ɔ̃nɛ ɓɛɛ jo ɔ̃nɛ gbete i bi kasiyɛ. I vi baasinɛ ɓɛɛ jo ayuu vigbete yɛ ãyi yusẽyɛ, i lɛri ɓɛɛ jo ayuu vi kotipimkɔ sheeli. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Ama u ɓɛɛ shɔ kolapayi, u ɓɛɛ jo ɗɔgbete u ga u shɔ-shɔraanɛ, Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi, u arɛ a kolapa. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Kirisi yɛ kɔsiu bi shɔzɛ vɔnɛntɔ, u risi naa u bi gbete shɔ basiyɛ, yɛ shovi au kaka gbete au sã ko-iviya awuni kpai.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nyakonɛ Gbete Bulus kosi Shɔ Sisɨn Ãnɛ a Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Aru nankɔ n shɔbiiyi, n ɔrɔɔ a sisɨn gbeteyɛ n kasɔɔ zɛnɛtɛ n ji zɛwɔ tɔɓa! Ɔ pɔ̃n sisɨn purutɛ, n baasi jo a ɔkɔɔ! n shɔbiiyi ɔrinɛyi, shɔmpɛ nɔgbete ɔ shidɔɔkaziti awɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a nyaba Uɓeyelapa kɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Yudiya a Sintishi, sɔkɔ n gakɔɔtɔ, ɔ nya u ɔ̃ gbete aru Uɓeyelapa nii. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Ɔkɔɔma, n shɔ wesayi, n kasirɛ ɔ pɔ̃si sumiyi naatɔ; aruviya i shovi tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm a nkɔni a ɗɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn nwanɛ, a Kilɛmɛn ɗɔzɔɔ au shɔvi shonɛyi zɔ gãsini kpai, shɔgbete shɔ beeyi nii tɛtttɔ a Ɗalapa laabeenɛ suruniyɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Mɛnɛ kopiɗaviya ɔ ɔ̃ a sisɨn puruni a ɗɔɔ yuɓasinɛ a Uɓeyelapani. N sha sɔ̃ntɛ tot: ɔ ntabiinyatɔ̃nɛtɔ!<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Ɔ tasi yuu roorinɛtɔ a ko-piyani. Yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔ ɓa Uɓeyelapa yɛ atɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ɔkɔɔ yɔriyuunɛ aru viwɔɔni, ama ɔ gaki Ɗalapa tɔ aru vigbete ɔ kasiyɛni kpai, ko-piɗaviya ɔ gakiu a sisɨn dɔ̃rinɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Ɗalapa sisɨn puru tɛɛ jashɔzɛ vizɛnɛtɛttɔ, yɛ kɔ ɔ sisɨntɔ a lɛrinɛni awɔ yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Au nyayisinɛ n shɔbiiyi, ɔ sisɨn u yii a vitɔ̃vɨng gbete n ti bɛlinɛyɛ: vigbeteyi pɛ nizɛ, vikasinɛ, vigbete au ã ɔ̃nɛ yuuyɛ, vigbete tɛpɛ-tɛpɛyɛ, vi ɔrinɛ, a vi bassinɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a vigbete ɔ matiyɛ awɔ tɛ ang naayɛni, vigbete n shaliyɛ a vigbete n pɛliyɛni. Ɗalapa gbete ãu ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ yɛ ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗa dɔ̃rinɛ Ayuu Vi Ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Ang n ɔ̃nɛ yuɓasinɛ a Uɓeyelapani pɛ vi binyatɔ̃nɛ ang ɗɔbiini, akɨnti ɔ̃nɛ dɔkɔkɔ gbete ɔ ji pɔ̃sinnaa ɓayɛ ɔ tasin sɔ̃ntɛ nɛi sisɨn doo ang biini. N jo sha ɓanɛ ɔ yang kɔnɛtɛ ɓa, ama ɔ ji kpaa nyaba tasinɛ ɓa. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />N ji sha ɓanɛ aru n ɓa vigbete n kasiyɛni ɓa, n mati nɔgbete n yɛ ɔ̃ yɛ tɛttɔ a vigbete n kɛ kpang yuunɛ ɗɔniyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />N zɛnɔɔ ɔ̃nɛtɛ aɗagbete n vi ɓa naani ɓayɛ, n zɛnɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ sɔ̃ntɛ aɗagbete n vi a naaniyɛ. N zɛu vaatɛ, nɔgbete kopiɗɔpiya, a kopiɗaviya, pɛlintɛ, ko vi teesintɛ ko vi ji teesin ɓa, ko n awuni bang ko fẽe. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />N yɛn zɛnɔɔ vi pɛlinɛtɔ piti kpai a kaka gbete Kirisi ang yɛni.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ama kɔrisitɛttɔ tɔ̃vɨn ɔ pɔ̃sinnaa aɗagbete n si yɛti yuyɔrinɛni. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Ɔ Filipiyayi ɔ zɛtɛttɔ tɔ̃vɨn a ɗaa n yaa Makidoniya yɛ aɗagbete n gaa ruu tɔ̃vɨn nwanɛ, si ji ɔkɔɔ sheeli shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gbete ɔ pɔ̃sinnaayɛ; si ji ɔkɔɔ sheeli shɔ gbeteyi kpaang vi tɔ̃vɨnrɛ a bintanɛni. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Aɗagbete n si a Tasalonikayɛ n kã naapɔ̃sinɛ ɔ pɔ̃sinnaatɔ tɛɛ ɓa gbete si tɛttɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ɓanɛ aru n kã vi ãnɛ tɛnɛ awɔ naa ɓa; ama n kasirɛ ɔ kpaa viwɔ awɔ ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Dɔdɔrim n tɛ vigbete ɔ ãyɛtɛ kpai, au tɛɛ vigbete n kasiyɛ tɛttɔ! Dɔdɔrim vigbete n kasi kpaanɛ kpai Abaporoditu n ting ɔ vigbete ɔ ang-yɛtɛ. i naa viyuu ãnɛ gbete sũrũ-sũrũ a shɔ ã Ɗalapayɛ, viyuu ãnɛ gbete Ɗalapa tɛyɛ au kasiyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />N Ɗalapa yɛ ãwɔ vigbete ɔ kasiyɛtɔ kpai, a ɓuzɨn u vinaa ɗɔrɔrɔ a Kirisi Yesɔ kabii. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Basinɛ yɛnɛ u Ɗalapa a Uɓeye ɗɔbi dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn dangdang! Nankɔ!<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyageenɛ Dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />N gee Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi kopiya nyatɛ kpai gbete i pɛ Kirisi Yesɔ ɓɛɛyɛ. Shɔ sisɨn anɛ gbeteyi aɗɔm a nkɔni i gee ɔ nyatɛ jo kpai. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Ɗalapa shɔbii gbeteyi aɗɔm kpai i gee ɔ nyatɛ, badijo shɔ gbeteyi a kpati kayisa nyaba wɛrɛm. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi shonɛ tɔ̃vɨn u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni kpai.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>